{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4295","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4295/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4295/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4295/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4295","id":4054950977,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7Ji1Tv","number":4295,"title":"[drawer] Make `data-base-ui-swipe-ignore` explicit for touch interactions","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619629096,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio-GKA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20drawer","name":"component: drawer","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the drawer component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-03-11T00:25:29Z","updated_at":"2026-03-12T14:30:02Z","closed_at":"2026-03-12T04:18:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4295","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4295","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4295.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4295.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-12T04:18:06Z"},"body":"<!-- Thanks so much for your PR, your contribution is appreciated! ❤️ -->\n\n- [x] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\n\nFixes #4294\n\n## Summary\n\nThis changes swipe-ignore handling so Drawer and Toast use the namespaced `data-base-ui-swipe-ignore` attribute, while Toast still accepts the legacy `data-swipe-ignore` alias for compatibility.\n\nFor Drawer specifically:\n\n- `Drawer.Content` no longer auto-adds a public swipe-ignore attribute.\n- Touch taps on non-interactive elements inside `Drawer.Content` still fire `onClick` without requiring `data-base-ui-swipe-ignore`.\n- `data-base-ui-swipe-ignore` now acts as the explicit opt-out for swipe dismissal, matching the Vaul-style behavior for the full touch gesture.\n- Mouse and pen interactions on `Drawer.Content` still avoid swipe handling so text selection keeps working.\n\nThe patch also adds focused regression coverage for Drawer and Toast, updates the docs, and includes a small private experiment page for manual touch testing.\n","closed_by":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://g